 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? Bicycle fitting means having bike that fits you properly. It's the right size of frame, seat height, and reach on handlebars. That's a nice thing to do. Most people switch at some point. It depends on how uncomfortable you are. A properly fit bike should feel almost like the chair in your dream room. Then a switch might make a big difference. You could try shop bikes at shops with rental bikes that switch easily. A quick check can help, but you' on the bike. A full fit at a shop with the right tools is reliable.",
